Wired spanning forest oriented toward a.text:
In this section we present two methods to generate the wired spanning forest oriented toward a chosen root vertex, which we will use to construct an initial rotor configuration for random walks with local memory in Sections  and .Let (G,c) be an electrical network (we emphasize that G is always an unoriented graph, and c\lbrace x,y\rbrace  = c\lbrace y,x\rbrace ). We now define the wired spanning forest oriented toward a chosen root vertex.
Denote by




















