Let $(G,c)$ be a transient network, and let $r$ be a vertex of $G$.
Let $x_1,x_2,\ldots $ be an ordering of elements of $V(G) \setminus \lbrace r\rbrace $.
Define a growing sequence $({{{F}}(i))_{i \ge 0} of oriented forests recursively as follows:
}\begin{}
